Force-plate analysis with a method registry

Usage: plateforce [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  analyse     Compute every number one trace supports, with the rule behind each
  batch       Run every trial in a folder under one request
  capability  Report what this build can do, for comparison against every other surface
  plate       Record a plate's settings once, and read back the ones this machine holds
  reach       Report what this registry reaches, per construct, and what stands in the way of the rest
  registry    Read the registry
  spread      Sweep a quantity over every rule this build runs for each step on its path
  serve       Serve the browser interface to this machine
  version     Print the version
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --registry <DIR>   Read the registry in this directory rather than the one compiled in
      --plates <DIR>     Keep saved plates in this directory rather than beside this machine's other settings
      --format <FORMAT>  Write the result as readable text or as JSON [default: text] [possible values: text, json]
      --out <PATH>       Write the result to this path
      --color <COLOR>    When to colour the output [default: auto] [possible values: auto, always, never]
  -h, --help             Print help
  -V, --version          Print version
